# Reaching points of a scheme-theoretic image

The valuative criterion for points of the scheme-theoretic image of a quasi-compact morphism
lives in `StacksFrontier/AlgebraicGeometry/Morphisms/Closure/ImageValuativeDiagram.lean`, which
this module re-exports: `AlgebraicGeometry.exists_valuationRing_of_image_point` gives the
valuative diagram over each point of the scheme-theoretic image and
`AlgebraicGeometry.exists_specializes_of_image_point` the resulting specialization.

